---
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="关于 RaceDocs · RaceDocs"
  description="了解 RaceDocs 双语模拟赛车手册资料库。"
  hasEnglish={true}
>
  <SiteHeader hasEnglish={true} subtitleZh="关于本站" subtitleEn="About" />
  <main class="about-main" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <header class="about-intro">
      <h1 id="about-title" class="language-pair">
        <span data-lang="zh">关于 RaceDocs</span>
        <span data-lang="en">About RaceDocs</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="about-lead language-pair">
        <span data-lang="zh">RaceDocs 是面向中文模拟赛车玩家的双语数字手册资料库，让赛车手册更容易查找、阅读和对照。</span>
        <span data-lang="en">RaceDocs is a bilingual digital manual library that makes sim-racing documentation easier to find, read, and compare.</span>
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2 class="language-pair">
        <span data-lang="zh">为什么做</span>
        <span data-lang="en">Why RaceDocs</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="language-pair">
        <span data-lang="zh">许多模拟赛车手册只有英文版本，传统 PDF 在移动设备上也不便于检索和对照。RaceDocs 将这些资料整理为适合网页阅读的双语内容，帮助玩家更快理解车辆与设置。</span>
        <span data-lang="en">Many sim-racing manuals are available only in English, and traditional PDFs can be difficult to search and compare on mobile devices. RaceDocs reorganizes them into bilingual, web-friendly references.</span>
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2 class="language-pair">
        <span data-lang="zh">原作者与项目来源</span>
        <span data-lang="en">Original author and project</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="language-pair">
        <span data-lang="zh">RaceDocs 原项目由 Moskic 创建并维护，原始站点为 racedocs.moskic.com，源代码托管于 Moskic/racedocs。本网站由 apexracing/iracing-official-car-manuals 自动同步上游项目，并仅增加 Tracklogic 主题、外部主题与语言参数及独立部署配置；原项目作者信息和声明继续保留。</span>
        <span data-lang="en">RaceDocs was created and is maintained by Moskic. The original site is racedocs.moskic.com and the source repository is Moskic/racedocs. This site is an automatically synchronized deployment from apexracing/iracing-official-car-manuals, with only the Tracklogic theme, external theme/language parameters, and independent deployment configuration added. Original authorship and notices are preserved.</span>
      </p>
      <div class="about-project-links">
        <a class="about-project-link language-pair" href="https://racedocs.moskic.com/">
          <span data-lang="zh">原始站点 ↗</span>
          <span data-lang="en">Original site ↗</span>
        </a>
        <a class="about-project-link language-pair" href="https://github.com/Moskic/racedocs">
          <span data-lang="zh">上游仓库 ↗</span>
          <span data-lang="en">Upstream repository ↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2 class="language-pair">
        <span data-lang="zh">独立性与权利</span>
        <span data-lang="en">Independence and rights</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="language-pair">
        <span data-lang="zh">RaceDocs 是独立的资料整理与翻译项目，与 iRacing、相关赛车品牌、汽车制造商、车队及其他权利人不存在隶属、授权、认可、赞助或合作关系。iRacing 原始手册及其中的文字、数据、图表、界面截图、照片和其他媒体资产归 iRacing 或其许可方所有；车辆及制造商名称、商标、Logo、品牌标识和产品图片归各自品牌方或相应权利人所有。本站对这些内容的翻译、转录、整理和网页化仅用于资料识别、学习与查阅，不改变任何原始权利归属，也不构成对相关商标或内容的权利主张。</span>
        <span data-lang="en">RaceDocs is an independent documentation and translation project and is not affiliated with, authorized, endorsed, sponsored by, or partnered with iRacing, the referenced racing brands, vehicle manufacturers, teams, or other rights holders. The original iRacing manuals and their text, data, diagrams, interface captures, photographs, and other media assets belong to iRacing or its licensors. Vehicle and manufacturer names, trademarks, logos, brand identities, and product imagery belong to their respective brand owners or rights holders. Translation, transcription, organization, and web presentation are provided only for identification, study, and reference; they do not alter ownership or claim rights in those materials.</span>
      </p>
      <p class="language-pair about-rights-license">
        <span data-lang="zh">项目的 MIT License 仅适用于网站源代码，不自动授权手册文字、译文、数据、图片、Logo、商标或其他媒体内容。使用相关内容时，应遵守 iRacing、各品牌方及其他权利人的适用条款。</span>
        <span data-lang="en">The project's MIT License applies only to the website source code. It does not automatically license manual text, translations, data, images, logos, trademarks, or other media. Use of those materials remains subject to the applicable terms of iRacing, the respective brands, and other rights holders.</span>
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2 class="language-pair">
        <span data-lang="zh">反馈与项目</span>
        <span data-lang="en">Feedback and project</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="language-pair">
        <span data-lang="zh">如果你发现翻译错误、版本差异或其他问题，可以前往 GitHub 查看源代码并提交反馈。</span>
        <span data-lang="en">If you find a translation error, version difference, or another issue, visit GitHub to review the source and share feedback.</span>
      </p>
      <a class="about-project-link language-pair" href="https://github.com/apexracing/iracing-official-car-manuals">
        <span data-lang="zh">本站派生仓库 ↗</span>
        <span data-lang="en">This site's fork ↗</span>
      </a>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script>
    import { activeLanguage, applyLanguage, bindLanguageSwitch } from '../scripts/language';

    bindLanguageSwitch((language) => applyLanguage(language));
    applyLanguage(activeLanguage(), false);
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
